WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.870
In a samurai duel of honor, Cosmo only rashly brandished his knife.

00:01:29.870 --> 00:01:36.070
With the enemy before him, fighting back was the only course of action he could take.

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:42.160
However, the duel was interrupted by Damido's actions.

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:48.120
<b>Burning Subspace</b>

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:51.370
He's over there!

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:54.230
Stop!

00:01:54.230 --> 00:01:57.940
Back then, why didn't you step on that alien?

00:01:57.940 --> 00:02:01.600
He's one of the higher ranked aliens, isn't he?

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:04.690
If he's a samurai, then we should fight him like a samurai would.

00:02:06.150 --> 00:02:08.130
He defeated me.

00:02:08.130 --> 00:02:10.230
I couldn't just step on him with the Ideon.

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:12.040
That's just nonsensical male heroism.

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:14.450
Isn't fighting a matter of life or death?

00:02:14.450 --> 00:02:16.660
Who cares about a samurai's honor?

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:19.250
You need to discard that kind of mindset!

00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:21.070
I agree with Kasha.

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:24.920
We can't afford to feel sympathy for the enemy.

00:02:24.920 --> 00:02:27.480
That's true, but they spared us too.

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:31.880
In that case, I can understand how Bes and Cosmo feel.

00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:34.000
We'll never escape from the enemy like this!

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:37.780
They'll let us go, all we have to do is to beat them.

00:02:37.780 --> 00:02:40.640
You can't beat them with that attitude alone.

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:41.760
Bes...

00:02:43.340 --> 00:02:44.530
A butterfly.

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:50.560
You people just treat me like a kid...

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:51.970
Damn!

00:02:54.450 --> 00:02:55.640
Incredible.

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:57.510
It's gonna fly away.

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:00.110
Pretty impressive.

00:03:00.760 --> 00:03:03.570
But how is that going to help you in a technological war?

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:06.490
You say that only because you've never fought in a duel.

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:08.120
We were fighting against a samurai.

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:10.990
The enemy is hung up on saving Karala.

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:14.380
That's why they haven't killed us all yet.

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:15.840
Karala?

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:17.830
Not "Miss Karala", Bes?

00:03:19.540 --> 00:03:21.040
Isn't that okay?

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:23.180
Karala's not gonna harm us!

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:38.470
Is that you, Damido?

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:39.850
Come in.

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:43.660
They say that humiliation is the best medicine...

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:46.720
...or was that alcohol?

00:03:47.270 --> 00:03:48.930
There's nothing to worry about.

00:03:48.930 --> 00:03:51.610
I'll explain everything to Lady Harulu.

00:03:51.610 --> 00:03:55.060
I'm just the right person to confront her.

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:59.270
With enough effort, I can make even your fight with the aliens seem respectable.

00:03:59.270 --> 00:04:00.280
You bastard...

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:02.190
Have you come to laugh at me?

00:04:02.190 --> 00:04:04.690
Would your friend laugh at you?

00:04:04.690 --> 00:04:07.040
I want to help you.

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:10.930
Who would mistreat a man respected by Supreme Commander Doba?

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:13.290
Sirs Gije and Damido,

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:15.480
I have a message from Sir Abadede.

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:18.920
A strategy meeting is about to take place on the Gataman Zan.

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:20.030
Roger.

00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:22.740
I don't need your sympathy.

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:33.350
That's right.

00:04:33.350 --> 00:04:37.870
We're going to force them into subspace combat and attack with the Gataman Zan and Giran Dou.

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:43.730
The Gram Zan will act as a decoy. We may have to end up sacrificing it.

00:04:43.730 --> 00:04:46.050
That ship is currently under Gije's command.

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:47.050
It's his responsibility...

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:48.020
I'll take the responsibility.

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:51.850
Do we have to go that far when Lady Harulu is about to arrive?

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:53.460
You just don't get it, do you?

00:04:53.460 --> 00:04:55.740
Think what would happen if we waited for Lady Harulu.

00:04:55.740 --> 00:04:58.390
We'd all be branded as fools!

00:04:59.310 --> 00:05:01.520
Let's do it, Sir Abadede.

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:25.000
A dinosaur!

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:26.380
A dinosaur!

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:29.840
Lou! You want to see it too?

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:31.730
That's a bad dinosaur over there!

00:05:31.730 --> 00:05:33.970
Is that one of the egg-eating ones?

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:36.490
Is that really a dinosaur?

00:05:36.490 --> 00:05:37.370
Lotta!

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:38.900
There's a real dinosaur here!

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:40.470
It's one of the bad guys!

00:05:40.470 --> 00:05:41.860
Why is it so mad?

00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:47.820
There are other dinosaurs over there!

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:53.110
There's a lot of them!

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:58.320
Don't you think they're acting strange, Techno?

00:05:58.320 --> 00:05:59.550
Yeah.

00:06:06.710 --> 00:06:08.300
What's going on?

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:09.760
They're gathering together.

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:16.770
Pay attention to the all the radars!

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:18.780
Let us know if something happens!

00:06:18.780 --> 00:06:20.650
Joliver, have you inspected the engine?

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:22.360
It should be able to start in one or two minutes.

00:06:22.590 --> 00:06:25.450
Good! Get the coordinates for M-84.

00:06:25.450 --> 00:06:26.510
If we can get away from here...

00:06:26.510 --> 00:06:28.020
Warning! The enemy is approaching!

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:28.990
Are you sure?

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:29.980
Yes.

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:34.830
It's awfully large, but not a dinosaur. It's the enemy!

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:36.420
Prepare for anti-air combat!

00:06:38.740 --> 00:06:42.790
We waste so much time on these
 discussions, I never have time to prepare!

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:44.430
Gotta hurry!

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:47.570
All gun platforms! Get ready!

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:53.760
All units! Our plan is to lure them in!

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:57.720
Do what you can to make the aliens retreat into subspace!

00:06:57.720 --> 00:06:58.750
Open the hatch!

00:06:58.750 --> 00:06:59.930
All units, launch!

00:07:14.110 --> 00:07:15.510
Their numbers have increased!

00:07:15.510 --> 00:07:17.450
What? How many are there?!

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:19.770
Their jamming signal is disturbing our radar, I can't tell!

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:21.770
Launch the Ideon!

00:07:21.770 --> 00:07:23.760
The enemy numbers have increased!

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:25.380
We can't do anything about that.

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:27.070
Isn't Bes going to pilot anymore?

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:28.740
You're better off with me.

00:07:29.210 --> 00:07:30.220
Let's go!

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:36.680
The normal engine's pressure is nominal!

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:38.050
We can launch, Cosmo!

00:07:38.050 --> 00:07:40.100
Hold on a second! What about our balance?

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:43.020
The main controls are your job! Don't be nervous!

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:44.480
Roger! Let's go!

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:46.580
Cosmo!

00:07:46.580 --> 00:07:47.930
Get a hang of yourself!

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:52.670
The power...!

00:07:52.670 --> 00:07:53.620
Cosmo!

00:07:53.620 --> 00:07:55.320
Idiot!

00:07:56.520 --> 00:07:57.340
Cosmo!

00:07:57.340 --> 00:07:59.070
There are people inside the Ideon!

00:07:59.070 --> 00:08:00.240
Are you trying to kill us?!

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:03.210
You raised the power too far, it's not my fault!

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:05.690
Do you have any complaints now?

00:08:05.690 --> 00:08:08.590
This hasn't happened before, though...

00:08:11.070 --> 00:08:15.010
The Ideon gauge isn't on, but the normal engine is working.

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:20.560
What's with the Ideon's energy system?

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:22.320
At least we can still use it!

00:08:22.320 --> 00:08:24.320
Enemy units detected at 2 o'clock!

00:08:24.320 --> 00:08:25.000
Roger!

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:26.980
All cannons, prepare for anti-air battle!

00:08:36.190 --> 00:08:38.260
Our missiles are only at 80%?

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:40.450
Why didn't we restock them?

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:43.470
That's why we can't rely on Kasha!

00:08:43.470 --> 00:08:45.690
She was adjusting the wiring for the controls!

00:08:45.690 --> 00:08:47.540
At least she's getting a little better.

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:49.130
We can resupply later.

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:52.090
Kasha!

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:52.830
It's up to you!

00:08:52.830 --> 00:08:54.420
Set the course towards 2 o'clock!

00:08:54.420 --> 00:08:55.430
Roger!

00:09:03.820 --> 00:09:05.170
Left missile ports!

00:09:05.170 --> 00:09:06.900
Attack the enemy formation to the left!

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:11.450
Cosmo!

00:09:11.450 --> 00:09:12.180
Moera!

00:09:12.180 --> 00:09:14.470
We should separate into 3 units!

00:09:14.470 --> 00:09:16.120
We don't have time for that!

00:09:16.120 --> 00:09:18.090
There's another giant unit approaching!

00:09:18.490 --> 00:09:19.570
It's the mother ship!

00:09:27.380 --> 00:09:30.000
Three crafts are heading towards the Solo Ship!

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:30.300
Roger!

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:32.020
The enemies are to our left!

00:09:32.020 --> 00:09:32.750
Okay!

00:09:34.900 --> 00:09:35.970
Kasha!

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:38.010
Concentrate your missiles to the left!

00:09:41.630 --> 00:09:43.310
Everyone is acting on their own!

00:09:45.700 --> 00:09:46.650
Damn the enemy!

00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:48.310
Are they going after the Solo Ship?

00:09:52.670 --> 00:09:53.920
How is the enemy reacting?

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:55.320
Nothing out of the ordinary yet.

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:56.420
Avoid hitting them directly.

00:09:56.420 --> 00:09:58.140
Just force them to enter subspace!

00:09:58.140 --> 00:09:58.990
Sir!

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:01.070
Lady Karala...

00:10:01.070 --> 00:10:02.760
Is this the end?

00:10:03.350 --> 00:10:07.370
I wish I could have seen you once more...

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:09.870
The Gram Zan?

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:26.270
The normal engine is ready for launch!

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:28.390
Let's retreat as fast as possible!

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:29.140
Roger!

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:30.730
Call back the Ideon!

00:10:32.510 --> 00:10:33.830
All units, keep pressing them!

00:10:33.830 --> 00:10:36.280
Drive them into subspace, no matter what!

00:10:42.290 --> 00:10:43.700
Lou! Piper Lou!

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:45.290
That's dangerous!

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:46.340
Lou!

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:03.860
Damn it!

00:11:12.050 --> 00:11:13.400
Okay, good...

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:15.400
Let's head forward and lure them in.

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:18.230
Make it seem like the Gram Zan is in trouble!

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:19.810
Sir! Rotating 60 degrees!

00:11:19.810 --> 00:11:21.380
You in back, use the anti-aircraft missiles!

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:23.200
Launch a concentrated attack!

00:11:31.940 --> 00:11:32.800
All right!

00:11:32.800 --> 00:11:34.600
The enemy's spaceship is damaged!

00:11:34.600 --> 00:11:35.970
Let's pursue them!

00:11:37.610 --> 00:11:38.260
Kasha!

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:39.160
Moera!

00:11:39.160 --> 00:11:40.450
Rise up, quickly!

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:41.200
Roger!

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:42.430
10 degrees to the left!

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:49.780
The enemy's fleeing!

00:11:49.780 --> 00:11:51.370
We should chase and destroy them.

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:52.170
Bes.

00:11:52.820 --> 00:11:55.640
I hope you can discard your weird samurai manners this time.

00:11:55.640 --> 00:11:57.610
This is a good chance to defeat the enemy.

00:11:57.610 --> 00:11:58.980
I know.

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:00.780
Ideon, chase them!

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:28.810
After you take in the Dekka Baus, start the first pursuit!

00:12:29.220 --> 00:12:32.020
We'll enter subspace flight shortly.

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:34.500
Standby for docking with the main ship!

00:12:35.570 --> 00:12:36.870
Lady Karala...

00:12:36.870 --> 00:12:37.900
This might be...

00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:43.780
Are you chasing the fleeing Gram Zan, Bes?

00:12:44.140 --> 00:12:45.090
Karala!

00:12:45.090 --> 00:12:46.740
Why'd you let this woman out?

00:12:46.900 --> 00:12:50.920
She said she knows the enemy commander's strategy.

00:12:50.920 --> 00:12:52.910
She could advise us!

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:55.190
You can't underestimate a man like Gije!

00:12:55.190 --> 00:12:56.650
He's up to something.

00:12:56.650 --> 00:12:58.210
We'll be in danger if we get too close.

00:12:58.210 --> 00:12:59.710
But that's the mother ship, right?

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:00.460
That's right.

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:04.170
So if we destroy it, we'll be free of trouble, right?

00:13:04.350 --> 00:13:06.900
Only if you can destroy it right away.

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:08.640
But can you?

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:09.840
Hatari!

00:13:09.840 --> 00:13:11.200
Joliver is having trouble.

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:13.520
The laser focuser can't be stabilized!

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:16.350
Ideon, do you hear me? Stop the enemy from advancing!

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:17.740
Roger, roger!

00:13:17.740 --> 00:13:19.810
That's easy for you to say.

00:13:19.810 --> 00:13:22.060
I didn't ask for your commentary!

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:26.570
Kasha!

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:28.200
The light in the middle is the enemy's ship!

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:29.240
Can you hit it?

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:31.150
I'm trying to aim, but...

00:13:31.150 --> 00:13:32.770
Can't we get a bit closer?

00:13:32.770 --> 00:13:34.050
There's something wrong with our power!

00:13:34.050 --> 00:13:35.680
Moera, what's happening?

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:41.290
Can't we avoid them?

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:50.990
Moera!

00:13:50.990 --> 00:13:53.360
The engine's pressure is dropping!

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:56.100
We're going to lose them!

00:13:56.810 --> 00:13:58.100
See!

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:03.610
Electromagnetic waves are rendering the radar useless!

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:05.070
Why'd we run out of power?

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:05.860
Damn it!

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:07.300
Cosmo, what about you?

00:14:07.300 --> 00:14:10.500
If you had gotten into a better position, I could have shot them down!

00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:11.510
Get real!

00:14:11.510 --> 00:14:13.870
We need something to power this machine first!

00:14:20.770 --> 00:14:22.780
Abadede's coming!

00:14:22.780 --> 00:14:23.940
Abadede?

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:26.800
A samurai who's an expert at subspace combat.

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:29.260
Gije must have asked for him to back him up.

00:14:29.710 --> 00:14:32.510
They probably intend to lure the Solo Ship into subspace.

00:14:32.730 --> 00:14:34.340
What do you think, Bes?

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:37.090
Subspace Sensor! How is it?

00:14:37.090 --> 00:14:39.420
The subspace seems safe...

00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:41.690
but there's some interference, I can't say for sure.

00:14:42.160 --> 00:14:45.870
If the normal engine can't perform better than this,

00:14:45.870 --> 00:14:48.020
can we turn on the DS Drive and escape from the enemy?

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:49.120
That should be okay.

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:52.640
What about the Buff Clan's Subspace Sensor?

00:14:52.640 --> 00:14:54.570
I don't know the details,

00:14:54.570 --> 00:14:57.060
but they could use it to pursue us as they wish.

00:14:57.840 --> 00:14:59.410
Sounds quite efficient.

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:01.810
Bes, that's enough.

00:15:01.810 --> 00:15:04.570
You trust that alien woman too much!

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:08.260
I'm not lying to you.

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:14.220
Your biggest lie is saying that you have never lied to us.

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:15.500
Also...

00:15:16.090 --> 00:15:21.350
You could just be saying things to cloud our judgment.

00:15:21.830 --> 00:15:23.320
How narrow minded.

00:15:23.320 --> 00:15:25.630
Right, I'm a petty woman.

00:15:25.630 --> 00:15:28.660
Bes! Let's escape with the DS Drive!

00:15:29.810 --> 00:15:32.610
Recover the Ideon! We're entering DS Drive!

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:46.450
Main engine!

00:15:46.450 --> 00:15:47.460
Standby!

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:33.020
Switch into subspace flight!

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:39.100
We're going to pursue the enemy into subspace flight!

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:57.550
Cosmo!

00:16:57.550 --> 00:16:59.300
Is it alright to leave your cockpit?

00:16:59.300 --> 00:17:01.420
C'mon, they can't catch up right away!

00:17:01.420 --> 00:17:02.620
Isn't the power rising?

00:17:05.640 --> 00:17:07.380
Moera! Aren't you supposed to be a pro?!

00:17:07.570 --> 00:17:09.410
This is different from a Cavian.

00:17:09.410 --> 00:17:11.370
You know more about this than I do.

00:17:11.370 --> 00:17:12.850
Let me handle the controls!

00:17:12.850 --> 00:17:15.530
Scientific knowledge is your strong suit!

00:17:15.530 --> 00:17:17.300
We don't need to switch places!

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:18.620
You idiot!

00:17:18.620 --> 00:17:20.760
I used to be a reserve pilot!

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:22.250
Is that anything to boast about?

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:24.270
Damn it! Get in there!

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:26.200
Moera's losing his temper!

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:28.790
The turbo charge control rod won't go in!

00:17:28.790 --> 00:17:30.350
Wait a little bit!

00:17:30.350 --> 00:17:31.920
We're in the middle of a fight!

00:17:31.920 --> 00:17:33.200
I know!

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:34.480
Techno!

00:17:34.480 --> 00:17:35.930
Can you get the power to rise?

00:17:35.930 --> 00:17:37.860
There might be a problem with the main engine.

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:39.750
The power won't go over 60% .

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:41.520
Yeah, we're trying to fix it.

00:17:44.280 --> 00:17:45.250
No way...

00:17:47.550 --> 00:17:50.100
Could that be the Buff Clan?

00:17:50.650 --> 00:17:51.830
Techno!

00:17:51.830 --> 00:17:53.200
Get ready for DS Fight!

00:17:53.200 --> 00:17:55.010
Really? Hey!

00:18:04.830 --> 00:18:07.080
The Gram Zan has entered subspace.

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:09.080
Good!

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:11.450
Launch Damido's Giran Dou!

00:18:12.060 --> 00:18:15.970
Our plan is to attack in three steps, "As, Del, Topp".

00:18:15.970 --> 00:18:16.780
As!

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:23.650
We'll attack with the first wave.

00:18:23.650 --> 00:18:25.120
Aim only for the bridge!

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:28.110
I see it!

00:18:28.110 --> 00:18:28.940
Behind us!

00:18:28.940 --> 00:18:29.620
What?

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:31.190
Aren't they in front?

00:18:31.190 --> 00:18:33.380
Ideon! Protect us from behind!

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:35.040
Huh? What?!

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:48.100
Did we get hit?

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:49.820
Kasha, what are you doing?

00:18:49.820 --> 00:18:51.520
The enemy's fast!

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:52.480
Obviously!

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:54.270
They aren't playing around either!

00:19:01.520 --> 00:19:02.530
Del!

00:19:15.570 --> 00:19:18.010
Why can't the Ideon launch?

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:20.880
In this succession, it can't go outside the barrier!

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:23.550
It's the pilot's job to go out there and fight!

00:19:23.550 --> 00:19:24.540
Hatari!

00:19:24.540 --> 00:19:25.930
DS Drive Brake!

00:19:25.930 --> 00:19:27.410
It's not working!

00:19:27.410 --> 00:19:29.130
The engine won't cool down!

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:32.370
It's not Abadede's plan alone...

00:19:32.370 --> 00:19:35.400
They're acting on the orders of my father Doba or my sister Harulu.

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:40.660
Orders to eradicate the aliens in order to discover the Ide...

00:19:40.660 --> 00:19:43.850
Even if it means killing me!

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:46.980
Otherwise, they wouldn't be attacking like this!

00:19:48.770 --> 00:19:50.200
That's Abadede's ship!

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:52.540
The man who specializes in DS Fights?

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:54.560
Let's go! Kasha! Moera!

00:19:54.560 --> 00:19:55.560
Roger!

00:19:57.110 --> 00:19:58.000
Topp!

00:20:14.190 --> 00:20:15.090
Lady Karala!

00:20:15.090 --> 00:20:16.150
Farewell!

00:20:16.150 --> 00:20:17.410
Is that Gije?!

00:20:19.700 --> 00:20:21.420
I won't let you!

00:20:25.770 --> 00:20:26.790
Karala!

00:20:33.310 --> 00:20:34.360
Moera!

00:20:34.360 --> 00:20:37.590
I don't care if the engine gets wrecked, raise the power!

00:20:48.520 --> 00:20:49.840
We're going to crash!

00:20:50.660 --> 00:20:52.350
I'll smash you!

00:21:14.090 --> 00:21:15.170
We did it!

00:21:18.560 --> 00:21:19.750
The Gram Zan!

00:21:23.230 --> 00:21:24.730
The DS Drive...

00:21:24.730 --> 00:21:26.380
The DS Drive is stopping!

00:21:26.830 --> 00:21:28.520
Cosmo! Are you alright?

00:21:28.520 --> 00:21:29.820
Yeah, I'm okay!

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:34.180
It doesn't matter where we go, it's all that woman's fault!

00:21:57.100 --> 00:22:01.020
Analyze maps of the entire universe and find our current position!

00:22:01.970 --> 00:22:04.130
Good job, Cosmo, you did well.

00:22:04.130 --> 00:22:05.510
Don't mention it.

00:22:05.510 --> 00:22:08.840
Where'd we DS Out to?

00:22:08.840 --> 00:22:10.180
I don't know.

00:22:10.180 --> 00:22:12.040
You sound so nonchalant.

00:22:12.040 --> 00:22:13.830
What are we going to do now?

00:22:13.830 --> 00:22:17.020
Who knows? What should we do?

00:22:19.020 --> 00:22:21.350
If you have enough time to complain about others...

00:22:21.350 --> 00:22:24.080
how about you figure it out?

00:22:24.080 --> 00:22:26.740
Aren't you an adult, Sheryl?

00:22:31.100 --> 00:22:34.500
<i>In the Solo Ship, drifting through unknown parts of the universe...</i>

00:22:34.500 --> 00:22:37.170
<i>The disputes between allies continue.</i>

00:22:37.570 --> 00:22:42.620
<i>Are they planning for what might happen tomorrow?</i>

00:22:51.520 --> 00:22:54.890
<i>The Solo Ship arrives at Crystal Star.</i>

00:22:54.890 --> 00:23:00.840
<i>Chasing them, Abadede sorties alone for the sake of samurai's devotion.</i>

00:23:00.840 --> 00:23:03.370
<i>He makes a surprise attack on the Solo Ship.</i>

00:23:03.370 --> 00:23:09.480
<i>In the middle of a Bajin swarm, can Cosmo
 take down Abadede's Heavy Mobile Mecha?</i>

